      "message": "QUIC: Pass FIN to subdissectors in quic_stream_info\n\nThis is necessary in order to eventually handle reassembly of\nHTTP/3 and probably other subdissectors on QUIC. Frames in HTTP/3\ndo not have an END_STREAM flag since stream termination is handled\nby QUIC:\n\nhttps://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9114.html#name-http-frame-types\n\nPing #16761\n",
